      ["LeanFM/Session/ExploreTests.lean: in Shop the outer choice spans its keyword line to its closing brace and its branches split at } or {, the inner choice and its branches likewise, a loop spans its block, each message node gives its own line, and two uses of one label give two lines", "LeanFM/MCPTests.lean: each compiled example equals its file; session_explore outlines GoServer within the result limit with include Challenge, and draws Challenge with focus; an example outside the list is refused naming the list and nothing of the named path is read; example with lean is refused; session_check of GoServer fits, saying projections were left out; 10000 GoServer sessions fit and carry the interleaving note; 2000 never-ending sessions are refused past 1000000 events", "scripts/session_view_smoke.js: the grammar walk starts from the main protocol on a canvas, sends a step to session_next, undoes and restarts; a role's state machine is a canvas whose transition moves the current state; a message shows its example JSON and protobuf", "LeanFM/MCPTests.lean: a GoServer message's example JSON, schema and protobuf block; the Bot's state machine reaches End; an unknown role and an unknown message are refused; session_next names a loop's state the same after a pass and differently after its end", "scripts/session_view_smoke.js: the tree is a list of rows like a file explorer, with no canvas; it starts on the main protocol with its source, opens a row with its arrow and closes it with Left, moves with the arrow keys, Home and End, opens a level and closes all, asks session_explore with focus for the diagram button and draws it, marks the Tree view; a successful call is not reported as an empty one", "LeanFM/Session/ExploreTests.lean: counting as sessions are made equals counting afterwards; the event bound refuses at its value; a three-branch interleaving protocol carries the paths note"]
