      ["LeanFM/Session/OAuthTests.lean: SignIn checks ok and reviews clean, keyed by r.state; a logged sign-in conforms; a callback with another state, an exchange of another code, and a log filing the sign-in under another session name violate; a token in a log is refused; the denied path conforms; sessionFiles writes the four files and each equals the checked-in one; the App document has the shared callback operation, a required state and an optional code parameter, and a redirect's Location fields; every role has states; a role that cannot name a file is refused", "LeanFM/Session/ProtoTests.lean: Lending's roles have states; a role running parallel is left out with the reason and the rest written", "LeanFM/SessionToolsTests.lean: two messages on one route share one operation", "the generated app-openapi.yaml and idp-openapi.yaml passed openapi-spec-validator, and Payload.lean and Implementation.lean compiled with lake env lean, while this was written"]
