      "LeanFM/Session/Evolution.lean: Global.compat projects every role of both versions and, for each shared role, runs Evolution.explore on the old locals with that role's new one (upgrade first) and on the new locals with its old one (stay behind). explore is a breadth-first search over tuples of local types keyed by their rendering, at most maxStates = 5000: Evolution.transitions gives a joint step when one role's send matches another's receive (Evolution.moves unfolds loops by Evolution.subst, interleaves parallel and join branches, and appends sessions bodies), an event step, and a commit step (Evolution.commit narrows a role with several own choices, or own choices beside receives, to one); a state with no transitions where some role is not Evolution.nullable is stuck, and Evolution.stuck says what each such role is trying to send or waiting to receive."
